                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年党风、行风建设工作思路<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 28.1pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">一、指导思想<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">根据市教育局《</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-no-proof: yes">二○一一年纪检监察行风、作风建设工作思路</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">》，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">坚持以科学发展观为指导，围绕“对学生一生负责、办人民满意教育”的工作理念，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">对照<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年教育系统行风建设问卷调查家长评议结果，认真查找和分析我校在党风、行风建设中存在的问题，通过机制创新、制度创新，不断加强</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">师德、师风建设，加强教师队伍建设，切实</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">解决师生高度关注的热点、难点问题，维护好全体师生的根本利益，确保我校党风、行风建设稳步推进，促进学校教育持续发展，树立学校教师的良好形象。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">二、工作重点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">加强党风廉政建设，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">积极开展廉洁教育，继续推进廉政文化进校园活动；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">加强</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">师德师风教育，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">强化职业道德教育，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">推进教师队伍建设，旗帜鲜明地抵制有偿家教；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">推进人事、工资制度改革，落实具体措施</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">，进一步</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">规范收费、办班、招生、执教、评比等各项</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">办学行为；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">加强师生沟通，密切家校联系，搭建多种平台，树立良好形象，进一步</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">深化家长满意工程；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">开展整改工作，对照<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年学校行风调查意见反馈，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">健全制度，抓好整改，进一步巩固工作成效；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">6.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">深化阳光工程，进一步加强民主建设，完善民主监督制度，健全校务公开制度。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">三、工作措施<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">（一）加强组织领导，落实责任措施<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．加强党风行风建设工作的领导<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">健全组织机构，成立由校长、书记为组长，党委副书记为副组长，副校长、校办主任、德育处主任、教学处主任及各年级年级长为主要成员的领导小组，统筹规划、制定落实我校党风行风建设的具体实施方案，精心组织开展系列师德教育活动，确保达到预期效果，努力形成统一领导、分工负责、协调一致、齐抓共管的工作格局。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．落实党风行风建设的工作责任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">把党风行风建设作为一项事关教育工作全局的重要工作纳入学校发展总体规划，加强领导，周密部署。学校行风建设工作有计划、有检查、有总结，确保分工明确，责任落实，并与各类评优、评先及年终考核挂钩。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">（二）加强师德师风建设，树立良好社会形象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．完善学习制度，提高理论素养。积极利用现代化教学设施和各种教育手段，采取集中学习、专题讲座、收看录像和交流讨论等多种有效方式，组织全体党员教师深入学习党的理论知识以及《中小学教师职业道德规范》、《教育部关于进一步加强和改进师德建设的意见》等文件精神，宣传先进教师的典型事迹，树立优秀教师的师德榜样，提高理论素养，完善自身素质。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 162.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．密切家校联系，提高家长满意度。充分利用家访、校讯通等手段和平台进一步密切学校与家长的交流沟通。积极开展“家长开放日”活动，进一步深化“学生评教师，教师评教师，家长评教师”活动。积极实施“家长满意工程”，通过每学期一次学生问卷调查，了解学生对任课教师的满意程度。参照教育局“家长满意工程”评比办法，对各年级、班级进行量化考核，开展“最满意年级”、“最满意班级”、“最满意教师”的评比工作。通过评比带动班级间、年级间的互相监督、友好竞争，找准存在问题，努力解决好热点、难点、重点问题，激励教工不断改进教育、教学和服务工作，提高学生对一中教工的认可度，对一中教育教学的满意度，树立学校的良好形象。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．开展廉政教育活动，加强干部队伍建设。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">大力开展廉政教育，积极推进廉政文化进校园活动，继续搞好学校领导述廉评廉工作。深化干部队伍建设，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">给那些有实力、讲实效、较全面、讲全局、肯服从、能服务、老实肯干，肯为学校作出更大贡献的中层干部提供一个展示才华的舞台，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">对那些师德师风好、教学业务精的老师，给机会、给荣誉、给舞台、给经费，为他们创造良好发展环境。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．加强师德师风教育，打造一流师资队伍。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">深入开展以“学规范、塑师德、展风采”为主要内容的群体师德创优活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">积极引导教师以恪守职业道德为己任，自觉履行教书育人的职责，做一名师德高尚、业务精湛的好老师。激励广大教师树立强烈的职业荣誉感、历史使命感和社会责任感，真正做到爱岗敬业、关爱学生、刻苦钻研、严谨笃学、勇于创新、奋发进取、淡泊名利、志存高远。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">自觉</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">提高师德修养，有效</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">抵制有偿家教。努力建设一支“师德修养好、教育观念新、进取精神足、业务素质高、综合能力强”的教师队伍，<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 162.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．推进民主测评工作，深化工资人事制度改革。进一步推进民主测评工作，继续做好教师民主测评、中层干部民主测评、校级领导的民主测评等各项民主测评工作，积极探索实施高级教师星级制和绩效工资制，对那些不遵守职业道德，不负责任，能力弱，水平低，不能胜任高中教育、教学和管理、服务工作，教工、学生反响大，有损学校声誉的教工，根据有关规定，进行交流外调或高职低聘、试聘、待聘、解聘等，督促教工终身学习，不断进取，适应现代教育的需要，确保学生拥有优质教育资源，享受优质教育服务。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 12pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">（三）加强制度建设，规范办学行为<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．学校依据《中小学教师职业道德规范》等相关规定，结合学校实际，研究制定操作性强的教师管理制度，明确教师教育行为的规范要求，把教师管理纳入规范化、法制化的轨道。强化学校日常管理，做到严格执行国家课程计划，不随意增减课程门类、难度和课时，严格学籍管理，不擅自招收未办理转学手续的学生入学等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; tab-stops: 256.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">．严格收费制度。严格执行收费制度，收费做到及时规范开具财政统一发票。实行教育收费公示制度，在校园公告栏公示收费项目、标准，自觉接受社会、群众监督。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 12pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">（四）加强教育宣传，深化校务公开<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">、大力宣传教育政策法规，宣传教育发展的氛围环境，宣传师德建设的新典型，宣传教育行风建设的新举措，办人民满意教育，做家长满意教师。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">、深化校务公开工作，增加教育工作的透明度。运用好校务公开栏、网上公示栏、阅报栏等载体，不断创新、不断深化校务公开工作。进一步加强学校安全教育、防范警示工作，进一步</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">规范食堂、小卖部的管理工作，进一步完善晚自修、住校生的管理工作</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">对于收费、招生、先进评比、特困生资助等群众关心、社会关注的热点内容，一律做到在校内外公示，对师生有疑问，社会特别关注的问题，尽量做到不厌其烦地向师生、向社会仔细解释，有效沟通。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 49pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 300pt; mso-char-indent-count: 25.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">2011.2.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
